android-dev fold device adapter
================================

`lib/fold.sh` is extracted from `scripts/xrctl` in the atacolak XR control
repository. Transport:

    this host -> SSH host `fold` (Termux) -> Fold-local adb
              -> 127.0.0.1:<current Wireless Debugging port> -> Android

The rotating Wireless Debugging port is discovered on the device. This repo
does not scan for it over the network, delete ADB identities, or replace
app signing certificates.

xrctl itself is unchanged and remains the XR project harness. Callers of
xrctl are not migrated here.
